sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Emp as Employee
  participant SPA as React SPA
  participant API as AccessRequestsController
  participant WF as WorkflowService
  participant DB as SmartServeDbContext (Azure SQL)
  Emp->>SPA: Fill title, description and category, then Submit
  SPA->>API: POST /api/requests {title, description, category}<br/>Bearer + x-correlation-id
  API->>API: [Authorize(Policy="CanCreateRequest")]<br/>DataAnnotations validation
  alt Validation or policy fails
    API-->>SPA: 400 / 401 / 403
  else Valid
    API->>WF: RequiresSecurityReview(category)
    WF-->>API: true for Production/Database/Azure/VPN
    API->>DB: INSERT AccessRequest (Status=Submitted)
    API->>DB: INSERT AuditEntry (RequestCreated, actor, correlation id)
    API-->>SPA: 201 Created + RequestResponse
    SPA->>API: GET /api/requests (refresh list)
    API-->>SPA: 200 OK [RequestResponse]
  end
  Note over SPA,API: Gap: API serialises enums as numbers (no JsonStringEnumConverter)<br/>while the SPA sends and expects strings, so category binding and display need a fix
